{"seq":1,"slug":"text-to-video","title":"文本到视频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-video","wordCount":2052,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本到视频生成\">文本到视频生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本到视频生成在图像生成的基础上增加了时间维度，需要同时保证每一帧的视觉质量和帧间的时序一致性。视频可以理解为三维数据张量（时间×高度×宽度），生成模型需要在这个三维空间中学习联合分布。核心挑战在于：视频中存在复杂的运动模式、物理规律约束和长程时序依赖，这远比生成单帧图像困难。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[文本到视频技术] --&gt; B[时序扩散]&#10;    A --&gt; C[自回归帧生成]&#10;    A --&gt; D[图像动画化]&#10;    B --&gt; E[3D U-Net / DiT]&#10;    B --&gt; F[时序注意力]&#10;    C --&gt; G[帧间自回归]&#10;    D --&gt; H[运动场预测]&#10;    D --&gt; I[帧插值]\">graph TD\n    A[文本到视频技术] --&gt; B[时序扩散]\n    A --&gt; C[自回归帧生成]\n    A --&gt; D[图像动画化]\n    B --&gt; E[3D U-Net / DiT]\n    B --&gt; F[时序注意力]\n    C --&gt; G[帧间自回归]\n    D --&gt; H[运动场预测]\n    D --&gt; I[帧插值]</pre><p>当前视频生成模型主要有三种架构策略：在图像扩散模型中增加时序层实现联合时空生成，将视频分解为关键帧生成加帧插值的级联管线，以及将视频编码为 token 序列后用自回归模型生成。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>发布方/时间</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>单段时长</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sora（公开版）</td>\n<td>OpenAI，2024-12</td>\n<td>DiT + 时空 patch</td>\n<td>≤1080p</td>\n<td>≤20s</td>\n<td>时空 patch 化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kling</td>\n<td>快手，2024-06 起迭代</td>\n<td>3D VAE + DiT</td>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>5s/10s</td>\n<td>3D 因果 VAE、运镜控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runway Gen-3 / Gen-4</td>\n<td>Runway，2024/2025-03</td>\n<td>时空扩散</td>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>≤10s</td>\n<td>参考图一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Veo 3</td>\n<td>Google DeepMind，2025-05</td>\n<td>DiT + 原生音频</td>\n<td>≤1080p</td>\n<td>~8s</td>\n<td>音视频联合生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sora 2</td>\n<td>OpenAI，2025-09</td>\n<td>原生多模态扩散</td>\n<td>≤1080p</td>\n<td>~10–15s</td>\n<td>同步音频、物理仿真增强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HunyuanVideo</td>\n<td>腾讯开源，2024-12</td>\n<td>双流→单流 DiT</td>\n<td>720p</td>\n<td>~5s</td>\n<td>13B，发布时开源最大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wan 2.1 / 2.2</td>\n<td>阿里通义开源，2025-02/07</td>\n<td>DiT / MoE-DiT</td>\n<td>480p–720p</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0、MoE 架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stable Video Diffusion</td>\n<td>Stability AI，2023-11</td>\n<td>图像到视频扩散</td>\n<td>1024×576</td>\n<td>~4s</td>\n<td>微调 SD 时序层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VideoPoet</td>\n<td>Google，2023-12</td>\n<td>自回归 Transformer</td>\n<td>1024×1024</td>\n<td>≤10s</td>\n<td>多模态 token</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>规格为各模型公开发布时官方披露的典型档位，商用产品普遍按订阅档位调整时长与分辨率；表中数据截至写作时（2026-08）可核验的公开信息。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"代际演进-sora-冲击与开源浪潮-2024-2026\">代际演进：Sora 冲击与开源浪潮（2024–2026）</h2><p>视频生成在两年多的时间里完成了三次代际跨越，理解这条时间线比记住单个模型更重要：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title 视频生成代际(2024-2026)&#10;    2024 : Sora 预览引爆时空 patch 路线(02): 商用第一波--Kling、Runway Gen-3、Veo(06-12): 开源起点 CogVideoX、Mochi、LTX-Video&#10;    2025 : 开源主力 HunyuanVideo 13B(2024-12 发布效应延续)与 Wan 2.1/2.2 开放权重 : Veo 3 引入原生同步音频(05): Sora 2 音画同步 + 社交应用(09)&#10;    2026 : 商用单段 8-15 秒、1080p 成为常态 : 开源基线 720p、消费级显卡可跑、微调生态成熟\">timeline\n    title 视频生成代际(2024-2026)\n    2024 : Sora 预览引爆时空 patch 路线(02): 商用第一波--Kling、Runway Gen-3、Veo(06-12): 开源起点 CogVideoX、Mochi、LTX-Video\n    2025 : 开源主力 HunyuanVideo 13B(2024-12 发布效应延续)与 Wan 2.1/2.2 开放权重 : Veo 3 引入原生同步音频(05): Sora 2 音画同步 + 社交应用(09)\n    2026 : 商用单段 8-15 秒、1080p 成为常态 : 开源基线 720p、消费级显卡可跑、微调生态成熟</pre><p><strong>闭源商用线的三条竞争轴</strong>。一是音画同步：Veo 3（2025 年 Google I/O 发布）首次把对白、音效与环境声作为原生输出与画面联合生成，摆脱「生成视频再配音」的两步管线；Sora 2（2025-09 随同名社交应用发布，引入 Cameo 数字分身机制）据公开报道进一步强化了物理合理性——物体碰撞、浮力等场景不再频繁穿帮。二是角色与镜头一致性：Runway Gen-4 与 Kling 2.x 都转向以参考图为锚点的跨镜头生成。三是可控性：首尾帧约束、运镜指令、多主体参考成为商用产品标配。截至写作时（2026-08），商用模型单段时长主流落在 8–15 秒，长内容仍靠分段拼接。</p>\n<p><strong>开源浪潮的里程碑节奏</strong>。CogVideoX（2024-08）、Mochi 1（Genmo，2024-10，10B，Apache 2.0）和 LTX-Video（Lightricks，2024-11，轻量近实时）打开了局面；HunyuanVideo（腾讯，2024-12）以 13B 参数和双流转单流的宽→深 DiT 设计把开源质量拉到接近同期闭源水平；Wan 2.1（阿里，2025-02，Apache 2.0，含 1.3B 端侧档与 14B 全量档）及其 MoE 架构续作 Wan 2.2（2025-07）让「在家复现 Sora 级效果」从口号变成现实。配套生态同样关键：FramePack（2025-04）用 next-frame 预测把长视频生成的显存门槛压到约 6GB 的消费级显卡；SkyReels-V2（2025-04）用 Diffusion Forcing 实现分钟级无限长生成。截至写作时，「720p、5–10 秒、单卡可跑、社区微调活跃」已是开源视频模型的默认基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序扩散与-3d-注意力\">时序扩散与 3D 注意力</h2><p>将图像扩散模型扩展到视频的最直接方法是在 U-Net 或 DiT 中插入时序处理层。在每个空间注意力层之后添加时序注意力层（在时间维度上计算自注意力），使模型能够捕获帧间的运动关系。时序卷积层（沿时间维度的 1D 卷积）提供局部时序建模，时序注意力提供全局时序建模。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class TemporalAttentionBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim, n_heads=8):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(dim)&#10;        self.attn = nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, n_heads, batch_first=True)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, n_frames):&#10;        b_f, h_w, c = x.shape&#10;        b = b_f // n_frames&#10;        x = x.view(b, n_frames, h_w, c)&#10;        x = x.permute(0, 2, 1, 3).reshape(b * h_w, n_frames, c)&#10;        residual = x&#10;        x = self.norm(x)&#10;        x, _ = self.attn(x, x, x)&#10;        x = x + residual&#10;        x = x.reshape(b, h_w, n_frames, c).permute(0, 2, 1, 3)&#10;        return x.reshape(b_f, h_w, c)&#10;&#10;class SpatioTemporalBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim, n_heads=8):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.spatial_attn = nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, n_heads, batch_first=True)&#10;        self.temporal_attn = TemporalAttentionBlock(dim, n_heads)&#10;        self.temporal_conv = nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, 3, padding=1)&#10;        self.norm1 = nn.LayerNorm(dim)&#10;        self.norm2 = nn.LayerNorm(dim)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, n_frames):&#10;        x = x + self.spatial_attn(self.norm1(x), self.norm1(x), self.norm1(x))[0]&#10;        x = self.temporal_attn(x, n_frames)&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TemporalAttentionBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, dim, n_heads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LayerNorm(dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.attn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, n_heads, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch_first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, n_frames):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b_f, h_w, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_frames</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.view(b, n_frames, h_w, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).reshape(b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h_w, n_frames, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.attn(x, x, x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.reshape(b, h_w, n_frames, c).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.reshape(b_f, h_w, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpatioTemporalBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, dim, n_heads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spatial_attn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.MultiheadAttention(dim, n_heads, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch_first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal_attn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TemporalAttentionBlock(dim, n_heads)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal_conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LayerNorm(dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LayerNorm(dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, n_frames):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spatial_attn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm1(x), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm1(x), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm1(x))[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal_attn(x, n_frames)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Sora 的技术路线代表了视频生成的前沿方向。它将视频在时间和空间维度上同时分割为&quot;时空 patch&quot;，每个 patch 作为 Transformer 的 token 处理。这种设计允许模型在训练时处理不同分辨率和时长的视频，通过调整 patch 数量适应不同的输入规格。3D 因果 VAE 将视频压缩为时空隐表示，大幅降低计算成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"帧间一致性与运动建模\">帧间一致性与运动建模</h2><p>时序一致性是视频生成质量的决定性因素。即使每一帧单独看都质量很高，帧间的闪烁、物体跳变和风格不一致都会严重影响视频质量。运动建模——学习和控制视频中物体的运动模式——是实现时序一致性的核心技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 运动建模方法&#10;        A[隐式运动] --&gt; D[时序注意力学习]&#10;        B[显式运动] --&gt; E[光流预测]&#10;        B --&gt; F[运动向量场]&#10;        C[条件运动] --&gt; G[运动控制信号]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 运动建模方法\n        A[隐式运动] --&gt; D[时序注意力学习]\n        B[显式运动] --&gt; E[光流预测]\n        B --&gt; F[运动向量场]\n        C[条件运动] --&gt; G[运动控制信号]\n    end</pre><p>Stable Video Diffusion（SVD）采用图像到视频的范式：首先生成（或输入）一张关键帧图像，然后基于该图像生成一段视频。这种方法的优势是可以充分利用预训练图像模型的能力，通过微调学习运动建模。SVD 在 Stable Diffusion 的 U-Net 中插入时序注意力和时序卷积层，冻结空间层仅训练时序层。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import StableVideoDiffusionPipeline&#10;from diffusers.utils import load_image, export_to_video&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;pipe = StableVideoDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=torch.float16,&#10;).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;&#10;image = load_image(&quot;input_image.png&quot;).resize((1024, 576))&#10;frames = pipe(&#10;    image,&#10;    decode_chunk_size=4,&#10;    num_frames=25,&#10;    motion_bucket_id=127,&#10;    noise_aug_strength=0.02,&#10;).frames[0]&#10;export_to_video(frames, &quot;output.mp4&quot;, fps=7)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableVideoDiffusionPipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers.utils </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_image, export_to_video</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableVideoDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_image(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_image.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).resize((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">576</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">frames </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    image,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    decode_chunk_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_frames</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    motion_bucket_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">127</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    noise_aug_strength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).frames[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">export_to_video(frames, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output.mp4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运动强度控制（motion_bucket_id）允许用户指定视频的运动幅度。较低的值生成接近静态的视频，较高的值生成运动幅度更大的视频。噪声增强（noise_aug_strength）为输入图像添加轻微噪声，增加生成视频与输入图像之间的多样性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长视频生成与级联策略\">长视频生成与级联策略</h2><p>当前模型直接生成的视频通常限制在几秒到十几秒。生成更长视频需要级联策略：将长视频分解为多个短片段，通过条件重叠或自回归方式拼接。关键挑战是保持跨片段的一致性——角色外观、场景风格和运动连贯性不能在片段接缝处断裂。</p>\n<p>常见的长视频策略包括：关键帧插值（先生成稀疏关键帧，再插值中间帧），自回归延展（以前一段的末尾帧为条件生成下一段），以及全局规划加局部生成（先生成粗粒度的全局轨迹，再在每个时间窗口内精细生成）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>最大时长</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接生成</td>\n<td>单次前向</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>~10s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自回归延展</td>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键帧插值</td>\n<td>先稀后密</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次生成</td>\n<td>粗到细</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>视频生成的计算成本是一个核心制约因素。一段 1080p、30fps、10 秒的视频包含 300 帧，每帧约 200 万像素，总数据量是单张图像的数百倍。即使在隐空间中操作，时序注意力的计算复杂度也随帧数平方增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(T^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为压缩后的帧数），时空联合注意力更是达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>W</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}((T \\cdot HW)^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级。时序压缩（如 3D 因果 VAE 将时间维度压缩 4 倍）、注意力稀疏化和并行计算优化是应对这一挑战的关键技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((文本到视频))&#10;    架构设计&#10;      时空扩散&#10;      自回归帧生成&#10;      图像动画化&#10;    核心技术&#10;      时序注意力&#10;      3D 因果 VAE&#10;      时空 Patch 化&#10;    一致性保障&#10;      运动建模&#10;      帧间一致性&#10;      长视频拼接&#10;    代表模型&#10;      Sora / Sora 2&#10;      Veo 3&#10;      Kling&#10;      Wan · HunyuanVideo 开源线\">mindmap\n  root((文本到视频))\n    架构设计\n      时空扩散\n      自回归帧生成\n      图像动画化\n    核心技术\n      时序注意力\n      3D 因果 VAE\n      时空 Patch 化\n    一致性保障\n      运动建模\n      帧间一致性\n      长视频拼接\n    代表模型\n      Sora / Sora 2\n      Veo 3\n      Kling\n      Wan · HunyuanVideo 开源线</pre><ul>\n<li>视频生成在图像生成基础上增加时间维度，时序一致性是核心质量指标</li>\n<li>时序注意力和时序卷积是将图像扩散模型扩展到视频的主要方法</li>\n<li>Sora 的时空 patch 化设计允许处理可变分辨率和时长的视频</li>\n<li>2024–2026 的代际主线：闭源阵营拼音画同步与物理正确性（Veo 3、Sora 2），开源阵营以 HunyuanVideo、Wan 2.x 把 720p 级可用性变成默认基线</li>\n<li>长视频生成依赖级联策略，跨片段一致性是主要挑战</li>\n<li>视频生成的计算成本是图像的数百倍，时序压缩和稀疏注意力是关键优化方向</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文本到视频生成","id":"文本到视频生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代际演进：Sora 冲击与开源浪潮（2024–2026）","id":"代际演进-sora-冲击与开源浪潮-2024-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"时序扩散与 3D 注意力","id":"时序扩散与-3d-注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"帧间一致性与运动建模","id":"帧间一致性与运动建模"},{"level":2,"text":"长视频生成与级联策略","id":"长视频生成与级联策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图像生成管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-generation-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"文本到音频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-audio"}}